---
// /brick-choir/2600 — Brick Choir, the 2600 edition. A video computer music game: your whole keyboard is the paddle.
// Press the key under the falling ball; the row you press picks the angle, the key picks the place,
// and every catch plays that key's note. A streak brings the band in. Mid-century take on the 2600.
// Rounds by the Architects: Terra (GPT-5.6 Terra), Sonnet (Claude Sonnet), Astra (GPT-6 Astra).
// Built 2026-09-23 by Claude (Cowork) for Mike. Rallies publish to /keyboard via /api/keyboard.
